    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:residenceMailbox is functional: a MailboxResidence reifies the time-scoped membership of a message in exactly one mailbox, so the mailbox the residence concerns is single-valued. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."@x-gmeow-english ;
